                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0eb3e404-124d-3267-8331-d1bb15fca8ef",
                                        "entry_id": "74ffe666-e8aa-3c4a-a075-f6c46ddf731d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The resident of Moab around whom the text centers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01a6ab6f-fdcd-4416-9252-238e319d7e18",
                                                "sense_id": "0eb3e404-124d-3267-8331-d1bb15fca8ef",
                                                "text": "And Ruth said, Intreat me not to leave thee, or return from following after thee: for whither thou goest, I will go; and where thou lodgest, I will lodge: thy people shall be my people, and thy God my God."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "137c0187-07e5-3ec1-bc0e-4bc91d1dce15",
                                        "entry_id": "74ffe666-e8aa-3c4a-a075-f6c46ddf731d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female given name from Hebrew."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f534040-be8b-4339-a4a3-290ec47ab3a2",
                                                "sense_id": "137c0187-07e5-3ec1-bc0e-4bc91d1dce15",
                                                "text": "Her face hardened.\n\"I despise pity.\"\n\"In spite of your name? Ruth is your name, isn't it? Piquant that. Ruth the ruthless.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "231d55f8-132c-461e-85bc-fcda81e232ed",
                                                "sense_id": "137c0187-07e5-3ec1-bc0e-4bc91d1dce15",
                                                "text": "He pictured the woman as dark and Biblical, because of her name: Ruth. Shadowed eyes and creamy skin. Torrents of loose black hair."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3cc9ffa-1c02-3430-b468-7bfa9d7a7740",
